  Version 20261014.1~sparky9~0 (2026-10-14)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Colours in the terminal, Daniel's own (2026-10-14: "I love colored console"): grep, fgrep, egrep, dir and vdir in colour and GCC's coloured messages, beside the coloured prompt and ls
  * nano is the terminal editor ("my editor of choice in terminal is nano"): EDITOR and VISUAL in the default .bashrc and nano in .selected_editor for new users; Debian's editor alternative already picks nano
  * nano in colour for every user and root ("coloured nano would be great"): /etc/nanorc is diverted and ships Debian's own with its first example palette on; syntax colours stay on as in Debian
  * command-not-found stays a dependency: a missing command names the package that has it

